  "content": {
    "id": "v2-dd963-p17-practice-slot-8-root",
    "type": "question",
    "label": null,
    "prompt": "Solve for $x\\in[0,2\\pi)$. Answer in exact form if possible, otherwise round to 3 d.p.",
    "layout": "grid",
    "columns": 2,
    "questionDiagrams": [],
    "children": [
      {
        "id": "v2-dd963-p17-practice-slot-8-slot-8-q-a",
        "type": "part",
        "label": "a",
        "prompt": "$2\\operatorname{cosec}x+4=0$",
        "layout": "list",
        "columns": null,
        "questionDiagrams": [],
        "children": [],
        "answer": {
          "short": "$x=\\frac{7\\pi}{6},\\frac{11\\pi}{6}$",
          "worked": "$$\\begin{align*}2\\operatorname{cosec}x&=-4\\\\\\operatorname{cosec}x&=-2\\\\\\frac{1}{\\sin x}&=-2\\\\\\sin x&=-\\frac12.\\end{align*}$$\nThe reference angle is $A=\\sin^{-1}\\left(\\frac12\\right)=\\frac{\\pi}{6}$. Sine is negative in Q3 and Q4.\n$$\\begin{align*}x&=\\pi+\\frac{\\pi}{6}\\quad\\text{or}\\quad2\\pi-\\frac{\\pi}{6}\\\\x&=\\frac{7\\pi}{6},\\frac{11\\pi}{6}.\\end{align*}$$",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
        },
        "answerSpaceMm": 35
      },
      {
        "id": "v2-dd963-p17-practice-slot-8-slot-8-q-b",
        "type": "part",
        "label": "b",
        "prompt": "$5\\cot x=-2$",
        "layout": "list",
        "columns": null,
        "questionDiagrams": [],
        "children": [],
        "answer": {
          "short": "$x=1.951,\\ 5.093$",
          "worked": "$$\\begin{align*}\\cot x&=-\\frac25\\\\\\frac{1}{\\tan x}&=-\\frac25\\\\\\tan x&=-\\frac52.\\end{align*}$$\nThe reference angle is $A=\\tan^{-1}\\left(\\frac52\\right)$. Tangent is negative in Q2 and Q4.\n$$\\begin{align*}x&=\\pi-A\\quad\\text{or}\\quad2\\pi-A\\\\x&=1.951\\quad\\text{or}\\quad5.093\\quad\\text{(3 d.p.)}.\\end{align*}$$",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
        },
        "answerSpaceMm": 35
      }
    ]
  },
